<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA barley export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 11,700 MT improved 57 percent from the week earlier. Ireland (10,600 MT) and Mexico (1,100 MT) were the buyers.</p>
<p>Exports of 900 MT--all for Mexico--were were 92 percent below the prior week and the 4-week average.</p>
</text>
